t_before":"...之。隋大业二年，集四方散乐于东京，门之于芳华苑积翠池侧。","source_end_index":649,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"3be39a04-e01a-5b9e-993c-bd69969c8156","source_start_index":631,"source_text":"唐贞观十一年，宴洛阳西苑，泛积翠池。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/二、河南府（卷四十八）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["史论"],"content":"9庚子，上宴洛陽宮西苑，泛積翠池，顧謂侍臣曰：「煬帝作此宮苑，結怨於民，今悉爲我有，正由宇文述、虞世基、裴蘊之徒內爲諂諛，外蔽聰明故也，可不戒哉！」","content_fanyi":"九月庚子日，皇上在洛阳宫西苑摆下酒宴，到积翠池泛舟，回头对身边侍臣说：“隋炀帝兴建这处宫苑，同百姓结下怨仇，如今全归我所有，正是因为宇文述、虞世基、裴蕴这班人对内阿谀逢迎、对外闭塞了君主见闻的缘故，怎么能不引以为戒呢？”","content_jianti_auto":"9庚子，上宴洛阳宫西苑，泛积翠池，顾谓侍臣曰：「炀帝作此宫苑，结怨于民，今悉为我有，正由宇文述、虞世基、裴蕴之徒内为谄谀，外蔽聪明故也，可不戒哉！」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":18977,"number":9,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"b8751181-db0e-11ef-aa5e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":579,"link_death_year":648,"link_td_description":"房玄龄，名乔，字玄龄，以字行，其神道碑则作名玄龄。清朝为避圣祖讳，又作房元龄。齐州临淄县（今山东省淄博市临淄区）人，唐朝初年名相、凌烟阁二十四功臣之一。","link_td_id":"Q10000485","link_td_number_id":78968,"people_name":"房玄齡","people_name_jianti_auto":"房玄龄","people_xingming":"房玄龄","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"b8751199-db0e-11ef-88f4-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":580,"link_death_year":643,"link_td_description":"魏徵，字玄成，相州内黄县人，祖籍钜鹿郡下曲阳县，隋唐政治家、思想家、文学家和史学家，曾任谏议大夫、左光禄大夫，封郑国公，谥文贞，以直谏敢言著称，是中国史上最负盛名的谏臣，辅佐唐太宗创建“贞观之治”的大业，被后人称为“一代名相”。","link_td_id":"Q10000181","link_td_number_id":104607,"people_name":"魏徵","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏征","people_xingming":"魏徵","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b875119a-db0e-11ef-ae68-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"10房玄齡、魏徵上所定新禮一百三十八篇；丙午，詔行之。","content_fanyi":"房玄龄、魏徵献上他们所制定的《新礼》一百三十八篇；丙午日，皇上下诏在全国施行。","content_jianti_auto":"10房玄龄、魏征上所定新礼一百三十八篇；丙午，诏行之。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":18978,"number":10,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b8751197-db0e-11ef-b4ff-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b875119e-db0e-11ef-a645-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b875119f-db0e-11ef-9865-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"b87511a0-db0e-11ef-8cea-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"唐初因魏、晉之制，諸王置師一人，開元改曰傅。","note_content_jianti_auto":"唐初因魏、晋之制，诸王置师一人，开元改曰傅。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"b875119d-db0e-11ef-bef7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"公主，上女也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"公主，上女也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"b87511a1-db0e-11ef-8a58-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"笲，音煩，竹器也，以盛棗栗腶脩。盥，音管，以盤水沃洗手也。婦以特豚饋。士昏禮曰：舅坐於阼階西面，姑坐于房外南面。婦執笲棗栗，東面，拜奠于舅席訖，婦又執腶脩升進，北面，拜奠于姑席。舅姑入于室，婦盥饋特豚，明婦順也。右胖載之舅俎，左胖載之姑俎，各以南爲上。","note_content_jianti_auto":"笲，音烦，竹器也，以盛枣栗腶修。盥，音管，以盘水沃洗手也。妇以特豚馈。士昏礼曰：舅坐于阼阶西面，姑坐于房外南面。妇执笲枣栗，东面，拜奠于舅席讫，妇又执腶修升进，北面，拜奠于姑席。舅姑入于室，妇盥馈特豚，明妇顺也。右胖载之舅俎，左胖载之姑俎，各以南为上。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":129,"tongjian_id":"b875e0ec-db0e-11ef-9e98-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"禮部尚書","official_note":"禮部尚書是唐代尚书省六部之一禮部的长官，负责礼仪、祭祀、科举等事务。在原文中，王珪担任此职，后被任命为魏王李泰的师傅，体现了其作为高级官员的地位和影响力。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"以禮部尚書王珪爲魏王泰師","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"c37122cf-e068-4e98-b477-91e2edd34134"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":571,"link_death_year":639,"link_td_description":"王珪，字叔玠，出于乌丸王氏。王僧辩孙、王顗子，唐朝宰相。","link_td_id":"Q10010246","link_td_number_id":998424,"people_name":"王珪","people_name_jianti_auto":"王珪","people_xingming":"王珪","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b875e0f1-db0e-11ef-a2b9-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":620,"link_death_year":652,"link_td_description":"李泰，唐太宗第四子，母长孙皇后，字惠褒，小字青雀，封爵历经宜都王、卫王、越王、魏王、顺阳郡王、濮王，雅好文学，擅书法，工于草行，集书万卷，是当时的书画鉴赏家。","link_td_id":"Q10007176","link_td_number_id":727952,"people_name":"魏王","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏王","people_xingming":"李泰","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b875e0f2-db0e-11ef-8312-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":620,"link_death_year":652,"link_td_description":"李泰，唐太宗第四子，母长孙皇后，字惠褒，小字青雀，封爵历经宜都王、卫王、越王、魏王、顺阳郡王、濮王，雅好文学，擅书法，工于草行，集书万卷，是当时的书画鉴赏家。","link_td_id":"Q10007176","link_td_number_id":727952,"people_name":"泰","people_name_jianti_auto":"泰","people_xingming":"李泰","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"b875e0f3-db0e-11ef-b381-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":620,"link_death_year":652,"link_td_description":"李泰，唐太宗第四子，母长孙皇后，字惠褒，小字青雀，封爵历经宜都王、卫王、越王、魏王、顺阳郡王、濮王，雅好文学，擅书法，工于草行，集书万卷，是当时的书画鉴赏家。","link_td_id":"Q10007176","link_td_number_id":727952,"people_name":"泰","people_name_jianti_auto":"泰","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"b875e0f4-db0e-11ef-8545-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":571,"link_death_year":639,"link_td_description":"王珪，字叔玠，出于乌丸王氏。王僧辩孙、王顗子，唐朝宰相。","link_td_id":"Q10010246","link_td_number_id":998424,"people_name":"珪","people_name_jianti_auto":"珪","people_xingming":"王珪","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"b875